WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In eighteen forty three, a surgeon offered a new name for an old mystery.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
James Braid called it nervous sleep. But a name is not proof.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
People can have vivid experiences. The harder question is what caused them.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Modern experiments test particular suggestions. They do not validate every audio sales claim.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying a meditation track, try a free twelve minute baseline and record what happened.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources, ask about the exact offer, and decide without the hype.
